{"nodes": [{"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_fundacao", "label": "Feature: Funda\u00e7\u00e3o (shell, contexto, erro, design system)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": "L1-L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Base sobre a qual as outras seis features rodam: shell de navega\u00e7\u00e3o, investidor de contexto (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 login), tratamento central de erro e funda\u00e7\u00e3o visual."}, {"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_001", "label": "US-001 \u2014 Navegar pelas \u00e1reas do sistema", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_002", "label": "US-002 \u2014 Escolher o investidor de contexto", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_003", "label": "US-003 \u2014 Entender o que deu errado", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_004", "label": "US-004 \u2014 Ler n\u00fameros e estados sem ambiguidade", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_investidor_de_contexto", "label": "Investidor de contexto", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": "L47-L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "N\u00e3o h\u00e1 login porque o backend n\u00e3o tem Spring Security no MVP; o contexto \u00e9 conveni\u00eancia de navega\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o seguran\u00e7a. Persistido em localStorage e revalidado na abertura contra GET /investidores (s\u00f3 ativos), porque GET /investidores/{id} devolve 200 para investidor j\u00e1 exclu\u00eddo e prenderia o app num contexto morto."}, {"id": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_traducao_de_erro_api", "label": "Tradu\u00e7\u00e3o de erro da API para a tela", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": "L93-L119", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Toda falha vira ApiError: valida\u00e7\u00e3o vira mensagem por campo, erro sem message ganha texto pr\u00f3prio da aplica\u00e7\u00e3o (nunca o corpo t\u00e9cnico cru) e falha de servi\u00e7o externo (502) oferece tentar de novo em vez de culpar o que o usu\u00e1rio digitou."}], "edges": [{"source": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_fundacao", "target": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_001", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_fundacao", "target": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_002", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_fundacao", "target": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_003", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_fundacao", "target": "_spec_features_fundacao_spec_us_004", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/fundacao/spec.md", "source_location